From 4ce6a38db11fbbab67ee8ad84bf55ad2a43d8e07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reedo22 <141674188+Reedo22@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:15:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] winecoreaudio: Leave out capture devices that never answer
 coreaudiod.

Attaching an input-enabled HAL unit to an unresponsive capture device (the
MacBook microphone with its lid cable disconnected; reproduced natively)
blocks forever, so winmm's start-up enumeration hung every game that loads
waveOut. Probe each capture device once per process on a helper thread with a
2 s timeout and omit the ones that don't answer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
